          "Virtual Claims Assistant keeps the original source and the correction note side by side for contractor estimate review. The file should show the approved claim scope, the contractor estimate and line detail, and the loss photos and adjuster note without requiring a second system login. A reviewer who has to reconstruct the source loses time and may accept a weaker record. The standard is not a perfect file; it is a file that makes the decision reviewable. The contractor estimate review reviewer confirms that the claim file shows this evidence before the next action."
